{"ID":"20240522082303-0u6gy3v","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082303-0u6gy3v","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082303-0u6gy3v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085308-2v5e2zw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085310-nuzmise\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:900,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522085310-nuzmise\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"不孕症的效果","type":"doc","updated":"20240522085428"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522085308-2v5e2zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-2v5e2zw","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中醫小故事【一】求孕"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-n9h9aty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-n9h9aty","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"An. L.， 四十歲，女性，2007年6月初診"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-mc7xyqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-mc7xyqp","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    L.先生是獨子，也很體貼太太，一直在旁安慰，沒關係，我們已經盡力了。L.太太滿臉愁容，蹙眉不展，可以感覺得出來壓力很大。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-o5bngui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-o5bngui","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我給予她的治療，超過五個月仍然未懷孕，但治療兩個月後手腳已從冰冷轉為溫熱，月經變的規則，腰腹來月經時也不再酸痛，諸證皆善，讓我不得其解。於是重新為他們診查一次，先生手腳暖，每日早晨，陽舉而精力充沛，平時常以【天雄散、漢唐斑龍丸、桂枝加龍牡湯】作為保養。太太如上述，脈證平和，左脈盛於右脈，查不出有何問題。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-uxdu82i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-uxdu82i","updated":"20240522085317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唯一支持我的信念，我相信"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"恩師的教導不會錯的，手腳暖，左脈盛於右脈，應該就能懷孕。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-d1flei9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-d1flei9","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「能不能劃一下您家中的方位」，我要求病人。好啊！她回答。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-wn6qf87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-wn6qf87","updated":"20240522085326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我看了一下方位，發現屋內東宮是個樓梯，沒有臥室！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（怪不得太子不肯來）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-63ndszp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-63ndszp","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「請妳放置一張娃娃床，在樓梯旁，震宮的卦位。」，她遲疑了一會兒，接著回答「好，我試試看。」"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-j5lq9yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-j5lq9yg","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"隔月，夫妻倆帶著燦爛笑容，告訴我，已經懷孕了。她說：「謝謝，謝謝，下回，您要我作什麼，我一定全力配合！」"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-jvl85uz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-jvl85uz","updated":"20240522085330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如今，一切良好，已近產期。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我心想，恩師真神人也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085351-2tunu40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085351-2tunu40"}},{"ID":"20240522085308-r1ep360","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-r1ep360","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中醫小故事【二】求孕"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-in758bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-in758bd","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Roci T.， 三十歲，女性"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-k7hym5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-k7hym5h","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2-12-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-guw8sis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-guw8sis","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原本是看不孕症的，但今日來診是為了急性右下腹痛而來。我問她，為何沒去西醫處診治。她說有一同事膽囊結石，開刀治療後，造成沾黏性疼痛，無法再以手術方法解決，為此痛苦不已，故尋中醫治療。其大主管為恩師的超級粉絲，故推薦來此。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-v82pzdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-v82pzdc","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者右下腹，持續性痛，已三天，無法入睡，疼痛拒按，彎腰也痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-zb4q20q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-zb4q20q","updated":"20240522085400"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刻下診查：脈滑數。舌尖右側明顯瘀點，邊齒痕。再次證明"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師所言：舌尖部主下焦，舌根部主上焦。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-nwtd8ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-nwtd8ez","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穴位診：雙足闌尾點壓痛，"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-s75eim4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-s75eim4","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹診：右下腹一處有包塊略高起，表面溫度高於周圍，且膚色紅，壓痛，反跳痛，手一按即痛得彎起右膝，直呼大痛，伸手欲擋，此乃腸廱無疑。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-m4ggu4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-m4ggu4k","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"急下處方【大黃牡丹皮湯】一劑"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-t96bd99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-t96bd99","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2-14-08來診"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-pm8a9ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-pm8a9ly","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥後，2-12-08當日瀉下六次粘臭便，並下許多小顆粒狀似糞球的東西，夜晚痛過一次之後即能睡了。隔天2-13-08仍瀉三次大便，。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-v787btv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-v787btv","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今日已覺好多了，但右下腹及右下背仍有微痛並自覺腫腫的，但摸起來不腫，不紅，皮膚溫度正常，按壓微痛，包塊縮小至中指指腹大小。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-lh7vecg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-lh7vecg","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方【薏苡附子敗醬散、四逆散、大黃牡丹皮湯加減】"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-c5trdbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-c5trdbd","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 沒想到5-3-08病人告知已懷孕六周，今日來診是因為腰酸，有時口渴，但不能飲冷水，飲冷水則感不舒，處方【漢唐腎氣丸】。之後沒再來看診。據其同事說，婦科檢查，一切良好，待產中。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-psw92es","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-psw92es","updated":"20240522085422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這是我第一次意外以【大黃牡丹皮湯】治好不孕症，足証"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"恩師所言，無論病名為何，有是証，用是藥。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-q31cd8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-q31cd8z","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"學生孟超報告到此7-27-08"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-afiz8wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-afiz8wf","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-esd6562","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-esd6562","updated":"20240522085428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-zo7voiw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-zo7voiw","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    孟超是我最得意的門生之一，第一案例中不孕症的補助方法就是來自天紀，當遇到天命中註定無子嗣時，就算你跑遍全世界西醫醫院都是沒用的，因為西醫的治療就是命，命中無子就是無子，命該絕了也就絕了，一點改變的辦法也沒有。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-zkyaned","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-zkyaned","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    但是如果你遇到的是正統經方家就不一樣了，我們上知天文，下知地理，中知人事，比西醫跟溫病派中醫不知強過多少倍以上不止，經方學就是人事的部份，佔有三分之一強，地理的部份又佔三分之一強，如果將人事與地理一起應用，就是佔有三分之二強，當然就大於天命了，於是天命就被更改了，所以內經中的著至教論篇云 : 能上知天文，下知地理，中知人事者，此醫道可以傳世。這篇所敘述可以傳世醫學的標準，試問天下可有哪些中醫能夠真正的做到呢? 我所傳授的人紀與天紀加在一起使用，就是可以達到此一境界的醫學，由上面案例可知，孟超是能得我真傳的弟子啊，很優秀很棒，能替人傳宗接代，功德勝於造七級浮圖，老師很高興得此傳人。"}]},{"ID":"20240522085308-upnamim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085308-upnamim","updated":"20240522085308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈謹記於台北07/28/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522085309-jrdlpcd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522085309-jrdlpcd"}},{"ID":"20240522085310-nuzmise","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522085310-nuzmise"}}]}